---
import Studio from '../../../layouts/Studio.astro';
---
<Studio locale="en" translationUrl="/narzedzia/" title="Architecture tools" description="Create an architecture decision record or draft a high-level design from a brief." active="tools">
  <div class="container tools-page">
    <div class="eyebrow">From an exercise to a document</div>
    <h1>Architecture tools</h1>
    <p class="intro">Choose the scope: document one decision as an ADR or draft an entire solution as an HLD.</p>
    <div class="tools-grid">
      <article class="tool-card"><span class="tool-label">ONE DECISION</span><h2>ADR editor</h2><p>Record context, alternatives, a decision and its consequences. Download Markdown for review with your team.</p><div class="tool-meta">No AI · nothing sent to a server</div><a class="button" href="/en/tools/adr/">Create an ADR <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
      <article class="tool-card"><span class="tool-label">WHOLE SOLUTION</span><h2>HLD generator</h2><p>Write a short brief and get a draft architecture. Verify its assumptions and open questions before using it in a project.</p><div class="tool-meta">AI tool · draft for review</div><a class="button secondary" href="/en/tools/hld/">Open HLD generator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></article>
    </div>
    <p class="follow">Want to practise your reasoning first? <a href="/en/practice/">Try an exercise</a> and see an example ADR after the analysis.</p>
  </div>
</Studio>
<style>
  .tools-page{padding-top:74px;padding-bottom:105px}.tools-page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,59px);margin:20px 0}.intro{max-width:65ch;color:#536577;font-size:18px}.tools-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin-top:43px}.tool-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce4df;border-radius:14px;padding:34px}.tool-label{color:#136d73;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.tool-card h2{font-size:27px;margin:16px 0 10px}.tool-card p{color:#536577;font-size:14px;max-width:46ch;line-height:1.7}.tool-meta{font-size:12px;color:#617880;margin:auto 0 22px;padding-top:12px}.tool-card .button{font-size:13px}.follow{margin-top:32px;color:#536577}.follow a{font-weight:700;color:#136d73}@media(max-width:720px){.tools-page{padding-top:38px;padding-bottom:70px}.tools-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:26px}.tool-card{padding:25px}}
</style>
